{"id":2325,"date":"2024-09-19T12:34:59","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:34:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2325"},"modified":"2025-10-02T15:38:19","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T15:38:19","slug":"lunch-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/lunch-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Lunch Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"775\">Printed Lunch Cardboard Boxes Supply<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"775\">Packaging meals safely and attractively is important for restaurants, cafes, and delivery services. At <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/a>, we offer <strong data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"231\">lunch cardboard boxes <\/strong>\u00a0that combine strength, style, and practicality. Whether you&#8217;re packing individual meals, catering trays, or takeaway lunches, our boxes help you deliver fresh food without leaks or mess.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"118\"><strong data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"116\">Custom Cardboard Bakery Boxes for Food Businesses<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"723\">We also provide custom <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-bakery-boxes\/\">Cardboard Bakery Boxes<\/a>\u00a0at wholesale prices with high-quality materials and fast turnaround times. You can choose from various sizes and printing options to match your brand\u2019s identity. These boxes are ideal for food businesses that prioritize hygiene, presentation, and convenience.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"979\">All boxes are food-safe and made using recyclable materials. With coating options like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV, you can elevate your lunch box packaging while maintaining product safety. You also get free design support and shipping on all bulk orders.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"984\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1227\">Cardboard Lunch Boxes for Catering and Large Meal Services<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1270\">Designed for Bulk and Event Packaging<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1390\"><strong data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1310\">Cardboard lunch boxes for catering<\/strong> are practical for serving many meals at once. These boxes are commonly used by:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1532\">\n<li data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1424\">\n<p data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1424\">Corporate catering companies<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1464\">\n<p data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1464\">Event planners and wedding caterers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1490\">\n<p data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1490\">School lunch programs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1532\">\n<p data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1532\">Non-profit and meal donation programs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1640\">They\u2019re designed to carry heavier meals, maintain structure during transport, and offer an organized look.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1674\">Options for Bulk Meal Orders<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1705\">You can order these boxes in:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1838\">\n<li data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1757\">\n<p data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1757\">Single-compartment or multi-compartment styles<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1794\">\n<p data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1794\">Flat-packed or pre-glued options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1838\">\n<p data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1838\">Custom-printed with your event branding<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1921\">Boxes for catering help save time during packing and improve delivery efficiency.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1926\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1961\">Lunch Cardboard Boxes for Kids<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2004\">Safe and Simple for School and Events<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2127\">We also supply <strong data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2055\">lunch cardboard boxes for kids<\/strong> that are lightweight, compact, and easy to carry. These are popular in:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2212\">\n<li data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2154\">\n<p data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2154\">School lunch programs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2171\">\n<p data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2171\">Summer camps<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2192\">\n<p data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2192\">Birthday parties<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2212\">\n<p data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2212\">Daycare centers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2323\">These boxes are made with secure flaps to prevent spills and can include compartments to separate food items.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2328\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2374\">Key Features of Our Lunch Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2414\">Quality and Safety You Can Rely On<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2554\">\n<li data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2455\">\n<p data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2455\">Food-grade and recyclable materials<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2488\">\n<p data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2488\">Leak-resistant inner coating<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2522\">\n<p data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2522\">Secure lids and locking flaps<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2554\">\n<p data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2554\">Lightweight and easy to stack<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2590\">Printing and Finishing Options<\/h3>\n<ol data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2757\">\n<li data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2628\">\n<p data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2628\">Full-color CMYK or PMS printing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2669\">\n<p data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2669\">Logo and branding artwork supported<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2713\">\n<p data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2713\">Coating options: Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2757\">\n<p data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2757\">Add-ons: windows, inserts, and handles<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2787\">Sizes for All Meal Types<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2897\">\n<li data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2809\">\n<p data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2809\">Kids\u2019 meal boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2838\">\n<p data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2838\">Sandwich and snack boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2867\">\n<p data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2867\">Full lunch meal carriers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2897\">\n<p data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2897\">Large catering tray boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2902\" \/>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Dimensions<\/td>\n<td>Custom sizes for kids, standard, and catering lunch boxes<\/td>\n<td>Kraft Paperboard, White SBS, Corrugated E-Flute<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Handles, Compartments, Inserts, Windows<\/td>\n<td>Takeaway lunches, catering, schools, events<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<t