es<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4153\">These boxes are designed to meet the demands of:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4278\">\n<li data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4176\">\n<p data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4176\">Catering services<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4201\">\n<p data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4201\">Cafeterias and delis<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4227\">\n<p data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4227\">School meal suppliers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4252\">\n<p data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4252\">Takeout and delivery<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4253\" data-end=\"4278\">\n<p data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4278\">Charity meal programs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4520\">Check out our Custom Food Boxes or Paper Sandwich Boxes if you want more packaging options.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4522\" data-end=\"4525\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"298\">Engagement Cue<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4640\">Get your custom <strong data-start=\"4562\" data-end=\"4597\">lunch cardboard boxes <\/strong>\u00a0today from Shop Cardboard Boxes. We offer:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4642\" data-end=\"4838\">\n<li data-start=\"4642\" data-end=\"4678\">\n<p data-start=\"4644\" data-end=\"4678\">Free shipping on all bulk orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4679\" data-end=\"4719\">\n<p data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4719\">Free design support with every quote<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4720\" data-end=\"4762\">\n<p data-start=\"4722\" data-end=\"4762\">Coating options: Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4763\" data-end=\"4796\">\n<p data-start=\"4765\" data-end=\"4796\">Custom sizes and print styles<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4797\" data-end=\"4838\">\n<p data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4838\">Fast turnaround and quality assurance<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"4894\">Please send us your specifications and get a quick quote now.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes offers high-quality lunch cardboard boxes at wholesale prices. Our boxes are perfect for restaurants, cafes, and food delivery services. With fast turnaround times and excellent printing options, we guarantee your packaging needs are met efficiently. We can accommodate custom sizes and styles to meet your specific needs. Get your custom Lunch Cardboard Boxes today!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2446,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[183],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2325","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-food-related-cardboard-boxes","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Get Custom Lunch Cardboard Boxes , Wholesale<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"High-quality, eco-friendly lunch cardboard boxes for food delivery and takeout. Durable and customizable with your brand logo.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/lunch-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Get Custom Lunch Cardboard Boxes , Wholesale\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"High-quality, eco-friendly lunch cardboard boxes for food delivery and takeout. Durable and customizable with your brand logo.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/lunch-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_t